      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Abbey Property Sales are pleased to offer this lovely 3 bed bungalow to the market just a short drive from the town of Carrick on Shannon.\r\n\r\nLocation Location Location.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated in a small developments of 6 houses.\r\nLooking out on Lough Brann & Siabh an Iarainn mountain this is a stunning location.\r\n\r\nThe property will suit many clients, be it a retirement home, or a starter home, It's priced to sell.\r\n\r\nAccommodation.-\r\n\r\nEnt Porch.\r\n\r\nSitting Room/ Dining Room. 6.19m x 4.01m. lovely room with two windows for dual aspect, New Stove, feature wood ceiling. stone floors.\r\n\r\nKitchen. 3.38m x 2.36m fully fitted units with appliances.\r\n\r\nBathroom. 2.23m x 1.92m.  tiled room with bath/shower, whb & wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1. 4.80m x 2.82m. large room with two windows for dual aspect, built in wardrobe & sink unit. carpeted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2. 3.18m x 3.03m. double room with carpet and sink unit. wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3. 3.06m x 3.02m. double room with carpet & sink unit. wardrobe.\r\n\r\nThe property has Gas fired central heating, Stove, mains water and new treatment system.\r\n\r\nThis is a really lovely property just a few minutes drive from Carrick on Shannon overlooking Lough Bran.\r\n\r\nPriced to sell.\r\n\r\nCall Gerry on 086 8066701 for further information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge, information & belief. The utmost care and attention on our part has been placed on providing factual and correct information. Please note that in certain instances some information may have been provided directly by the vendor to ourselves. Whilst due attention and care is taken in preparing particulars, this firm does not hold itself responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have."
      },
